    \item This is the gold standard for overfitting assessment
\end{itemize}

\textbf{3. Events Per Variable (EPV):}
\begin{itemize}
    \item 1,976 outbreaks ÷ 12 predictors = 165 EPV
    \item Recommended minimum: 10 EPV (Peduzzi et al. 1996)
    \item We exceed this by 16-fold
    \item Conservative studies suggest 20 EPV—we still exceed by 8-fold
